# EAS Build zips up this whole folder and uploads it before building.
# Without this file it has no way to know what to skip (this project isn't
# a git repo, so .gitignore doesn't apply here) — it was including
# node_modules, which is hundreds of MB and can exhaust local disk space
# while EAS compresses the upload tarball. EAS reinstalls dependencies
# fresh on its own build machine anyway, so none of this needs to be sent.
node_modules
.expo
.git
android
ios
dist
web-build
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
google-play-service-account.json
